    {
      "section": "legal.clause",
      "content": {
        "label": "(THE CONTACT FORM)",
        "paragraphs": [
          "If you write to me through the form, what you type - your name, email, phone if you add one, the reason you picked and your message - is delivered straight to my inbox."
        ]
      },
      "motion": {
        "pattern": "none",
        "reducedMotionFallback": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "section": "legal.clause",
      "content": {
        "label": "(THE SHOP & PAYMENTS)",
        "paragraphs": [
          "Buying a piece happens on Stripe's own hosted checkout page - your card details go to Stripe, never to this site, which never sees and never stores them."
        ]
      },
      "motion": {
        "pattern": "none",
        "reducedMotionFallback": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "section": "legal.clause",
      "content": {
        "label": "(THE DROPS LIST)",
        "paragraphs": [
          "The shop has one field that asks for an email address, and it does exactly what it says: it tells you when new work lands."
        ]
      },
      "motion": {
        "pattern": "none",
        "reducedMotionFallback": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "section": "legal.clause",
      "content": {
        "label": "(ANALYTICS)",
        "paragraphs": [
          "Two things count visits here, and only one of them asks first."
        ]
      },
      "motion": {
        "pattern": "none",
        "reducedMotionFallback": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "section": "legal.clause",
      "content": {
        "label": "(COOKIES)",
        "paragraphs": [
          "The site itself sets no cookies. It keeps one value in your browser's local storage to remember your cookie choice, and Google Analytics sets its cookies only after you accept:"
        ],
        "action": "Reset cookie choice"
      },
      "motion": {
        "pattern": "none",
        "reducedMotionFallback": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "section": "legal.clause",
      "content": {
        "label": "(HOSTING)",
        "paragraphs": [
          "The site is served by Vercel. Like any host, it processes the technical side of a request - your IP address and the page you asked for - to deliver the site and protect it from abuse."
        ]
      },
      "motion": {
        "pattern": "none",
        "reducedMotionFallback": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "section": "legal.clause",
      "content": {
        "label": "(YOUR RIGHTS)",
        "paragraphs": [
          "Under Israel's Privacy Protection Law - and the GDPR, if you are writing from the EU - you can ask to see, correct or delete personal information held about you."
        ]
      },
      "motion": {
        "pattern": "none",
        "reducedMotionFallback": "none"
      }
    },
